<div class="pt-20 pb-4 md:py-12 bg-body dark:bg-body-dark">
  <div class="px-4 mx-auto max-w-7xl sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="lg:text-center">
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-8 text-purple dark:text-purple-dark sm:text-4xl">
        <%= gettext("Get Involved") %>
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mt-4 text-xl text-light dark:text-light-dark lg:mx-auto">
        <%= gettext("DevSecRelAI is built by practitioners and contributors. Help make secure, reliable, AI-enabled delivery easier to learn and apply. Here are a few ways to contribute.") %>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="bg-body dark:bg-body-dark px-4 lg:px-0">
  <div>
    <div class="flex my-12">
      <svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
      </svg>
      <div class="ml-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-heavy dark:text-heavy-dark leading-6">
          <%= gettext("Improve the Website") %>
        </h3>
        <div class="mt-2 text-base text-light dark:text-light-dark">
          <%= gettext("DevSecRelAI is an open source project, with code hosted on") %> <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/DevSecRelAI/devsec-rel-ai" class="font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark">GitHub</a>.
          <%= gettext("Take a look at the") %> <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/DevSecRelAI/devsec-rel-ai/issues" class="font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark"><%= gettext("issues") %></a> <%= gettext("on the repository to find a task that interests you. Create a pull request when your change is ready and after review it will be merged into the codebase!") %>
          <%= gettext("See something you think should be improved? Feel free to open an issue or create a pull request with the change.") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex my-12">
      <!-- Heroicon name: outline/check -->
      <svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
      </svg>
      <div class="ml-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-heavy dark:text-heavy-dark leading-6">
          <%= gettext("Translate Lessons") %>
        </h3>
        <div class="mt-2 text-base text-light dark:text-light-dark">
          <%= gettext("As the curriculum grows, translations make the material accessible to more practitioners. If you can translate or improve a lesson, please open a pull request.") %>
          <%= gettext("As you read lessons, if you see an opportunity for improvement go ahead and create a pull request with the change. Guidance for contributing content") %>
          <%= gettext("is available on") %> <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/DevSecRelAI/devsec-rel-ai" class="font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark">GitHub</a>.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex my-12">
      <!-- Heroicon name: outline/check -->
      <svg class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
      </svg>
      <div class="ml-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-heavy dark:text-heavy-dark leading-6">
          <%= gettext("Contribute to the Blog") %>
        </h3>
        <div class="mt-2 text-base text-light dark:text-light-dark">
          <%= gettext("Have a practical perspective on developer relations, security, reliability, or AI that you want to share? Write a post and it could be featured on the DevSecRelAI feed.") %>
          <%= gettext("This is a great way to contribute and get visibility for your post! Steps for submitting a post are available on") %>
          <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/DevSecRelAI/devsec-rel-ai" class="font-bold text-purple dark:text-purple-dark">GitHub</a>.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
